{{!
    @template theme_tresa/frontpage-features
    Front page "Why learn with us" - 4 static feature highlight cards,
    each fading in a little after the last (see lib.php:
    theme_tresa_get_frontpage_features_context()).

    Context: features.title, features.features [{icon, title, text, delay}].

    Dot-notation throughout - see frontpage-steps.mustache's docblock for
    why (same partial-sharing-the-parent's-whole-context reason, same
    self-collision this template also had until fixed: the bare, undotted
    section name here previously resolved to the wrapper hash itself
    instead of looping the list one level inside it). That docblock also
    explains why no literal double-brace syntax should ever be written in
    this comment as an illustrative example.
}}
<section class="tresa-features tresa-section">
    <div class="tresa-features__header">
        <h2 class="tresa-features__title">{{features.title}}</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="tresa-features__grid">
        {{#features.features}}
        <div class="tresa-feature tresa-reveal" style="transition-delay: {{delay}}ms;">
            <span class="tresa-feature__icon"><i class="fa {{icon}}" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
            <h3 class="tresa-feature__title">{{title}}</h3>
            <p class="tresa-feature__text">{{text}}</p>
        </div>
        {{/features.features}}
    </div>
</section>
